## How much of the cache-miss penalty VIP removes (size sweep, `rvv_orig`)

Gap = stride cycles − stride cycles of the same kernel on the 8 KiB-`x` input (same rows/nnz, gathers hit in L1). Gap closed = (stride − VIP) / gap.

| dist | x size | 8 KiB-x cycles | stride cycles | VIP cycles | upper-bound speedup | gap closed by VIP |
