| power-law | – | – | – | – | – | – |
| uniform | 32 KiB | 566,259 | 587,224 | 552,974 | 1.04× | 163.4% |
| uniform | 128 KiB | 566,259 | 904,211 | 923,408 | 1.60× | -5.7% |
| uniform | 512 KiB | 566,259 | 1,389,015 | 990,512 | 2.45× | 48.4% |
| uniform | 2048 KiB | 566,259 | 2,084,368 | 1,947,754 | 3.68× | 9.0% |

